      "text": "# define optional variables in \"piptm.optional_vars\"\n# builds/checks tm_variable_spec.yaml -labels, roles, stat groups..\n# build variable registry: \n    - merge tm_variable_spec YAML and pipdata recode_spec. \n   -> Saved as json in registry/ \n\n.onLoad:\n- load registry\n- pip_arrow_schema(): required fields - opional fields from\n\"piptm.optional_vars\" - mappings from registry \n",
